  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "全世界のガンプラファンにむけた、公式ガンプラ総合施設「ガンダムベース」の限定ガンプラです。",
      "en": "A limited edition Gunpla at the official Gunpla facility \"Gundam Base\" for Gunpla fans around the world."
    },
    {
      "ja": "川口名人完全監修！ザクII TYPE C-6/R6のペインティングモデルが登場！",
      "en": "Fully supervised by Master Kawaguchi! Zaku II TYPE C-6/R6 painting model is now available!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "●塗装に最適な、シンプルな色数のランナーが付属！",
      "en": "●Comes with a simple color Runner that is perfect for painting!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "●肩のスパイクアーマー接続箇所や胸部装甲のバルカン砲も精密に再現！",
      "en": "-The spike armor connection point on the shoulder and the Vulcan cannon on the chest armor are also precisely reproduced!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "●ベルト給弾式マシンガンをはじめ、豊富な武装が付属！",
      "en": "- Comes with a wide variety of armaments, including a belt-fed machine gun!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "●川口名人による、制作ワンポイントテクニックの解説が付属！",
      "en": "●Comes with an explanation of one-point production techniques by Master Kawaguchi!"
    }
  ],
  "accessories": [
    {
      "ja": "ベルト給弾式マシンガン×1",
